  "body": " Converting Length Units   Let’s say that you are helping design a phone for a big company that has offices in the USA and in London. The office in London requests that the height of the phone be specified in centimeters. You know that the phone is inches tall.  Using the conversion factor from inches to centimeters ( ) and the process outlined above, what is the height of the phone in centimeters?  The height of the phone is centimeters.          "
