  "body": " Finding the Bug   For the next question, consider the following algorithm for determining where to go out to eat with a boyfriend or girlfriend.  Find the bug in the algorithm and select the line number that contains the error.        Line 1    Incorrect. The bug is not on line 1.      Line 3    Incorrect. The bug is not on line 3.      Line 5    Incorrect. The bug is not on line 5.      Line 7    Correct. The bug is located on line 7.      Line 9    Incorrect. The bug is not on line 9.     "
