  "body": " MATLAB Conditional Output   Do not just type this into MATLAB. Try it by hand first! That is how you learn. Consider the following script file:  x = 10; y = x - 4; z = 2*x + y; if x > y & z == 25 output = x + y + z; else output = x - y - z; end  What is the value in the variable output when the program is finished running? output =           "
