  "body": " What is your flowchart?   For this discussion, write out your pseudocode that you came up with to solve the Maclaurin series “number of terms” problem described directly above.  Think about how this planning translated into your code. WHat steps(if any) did you miss? Where can you improve in the planning or coding stage?    "
