  "title": "<code class=\"code-inline tex2jax_ignore\">sphere_vol()<\/code> complete.",
  "body": "  sphere_vol() complete   Here is an interactive code box that functions identically to the MATLAB command window.  function [volume] = sphere_vol(radii) % sphere_vol calculates the volume of a sphere % This function accepts either a scalar radius or array of radii and returns a scalr or array of volumes respectively. % Inputs: % radii - a scalar radius or array of radii % Outputs: % volume - a scalar volume or array of volumes volume = (4\/3)*pi*(radii.^3) end   "
